  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build Universal Health Care Program (Subprogram 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Subprogram 2 builds on government efforts to implement the three key reform areas of the Universal Health Care (UHC) Act of 2019: (i) sustainable financing and strategic purchasing, (ii) integrated delivery of quality health services, and (iii) information management and performance accountability. The programmatic approach will support systematic national and local implementation of health policy reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
